            <div xml:id="d691">

                <pb facs="0807" n="797" sameAs="frus:frus1948v07/pg797"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">121.67/11–148: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Consul General at
                        Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-11-01T15:00:00-05:00">November 1, 1948—3
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1843. Essential reestablish contact Dairen. Report feasibility two couriers
                    traveling there via Vladi. One should have made trip before. Report tentative
                    date departure Shanghai.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
